<Project xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/developer/msbuild/2003">

  <!--
    Intentionally empty.

    NuGet expects a build/<id>.targets next to any TFM-specific one (NU5129), and auto-imports
    the most specific match: a net462 or net48 project gets build/<tfm>/XrmFramework.Plugin.targets
    and never this file. It exists so that a project on some other target framework - which this
    package has no assets for anyway - is not handed plugin build logic that does not apply to it.

    The shared logic lives in Shared/XrmFramework.Plugin.Package.targets, imported from each
    TFM-specific .targets.
  -->

</Project>
